    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every child does it. Every child is afraid of it. What is it? It’s homework!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You want to play outside or watch a TV show after school, but you have to do your homework first. Why? It’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for you!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Homework "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "builds a bridge",
            "ref": "v-build-a-bridge"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between school and home. Your parents know "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about you when you’re at school. Homework lets them "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "keep up with",
            "ref": "v-keep-up-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what you’re doing in your class."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Homework can help you become a better student. It can help you "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the next day’s class. For example, you have a history lesson tomorrow. It’s very "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "helpful",
            "ref": "v-helpful"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to do the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "background",
            "ref": "v-background"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " reading as homework tonight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Homework also gives you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practice",
            "ref": "v-practice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " outside the classroom. Class time is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to learn something new. Practising at home can help you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "keep in mind",
            "ref": "v-keep-in-mind"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the things you have learned. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Practice makes perfect",
            "ref": "v-practice-makes-perfect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As you learn more, you "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more, and doing homework helps."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
